stateDiagram-v2
    working: working<br/>deque not empty or limit reached
    stealing: stealing<br/>one request in flight
    backoff: backing off<br/>timer armed
    [*] --> working
    working --> stealing: evaluator ends,<br/>deque empty
    stealing --> working: piece received,<br/>reset back-off,<br/>start evaluator
    stealing --> backoff: none,<br/>double back-off
    backoff --> stealing: timer,<br/>ask a random peer
    backoff --> working: local push
    note right of stealing
        no reply before the timer fires:
        double back-off, ask another victim at once
    end note
